# bmcd is a cargo package: Buildroot fetches the GitHub archive, runs
# `cargo vendor`, and stores the re-packed archive (the "-cargo2" suffix)
# -- so the sum covers the vendored crates too, exactly as Buildroot does
# for its own cargo packages. Computed with rust-bin 1.85.0 in the pinned
# container on 2026-09-07; a Rust bump can legitimately change it.
# The version is a commit on excavador/bmcd branch `hive` (v2.3.7 plus
# the preserve-power-state change from SQU-114, the About-page fields and
# off-the-RAM-disk staging from SQU-124, and the switch-state endpoint,
# board serial and power_on_time fix from SQU-127), not an upstream tag.
# Locally computed:
